cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DeepHostGuest in your research, please cite the manuscript below."
type: software
title: "DeepHostGuest: geometric deep learning for supramolecular host-guest binding-conformation prediction"
abstract: >-
  DeepHostGuest is a geometric deep learning framework that learns crystal-structure-informed
  host-guest distance preferences from experimentally resolved supramolecular complexes and
  predicts guest binding conformations inside host cavities, optionally followed by GFN2-xTB
  geometry refinement. The repository contains the full pipeline: dataset construction,
  data augmentation, model training, pose prediction, crystalline-sponge prediction,
  and downstream binding-strength analysis (DFT-correlation workflow and AutoGluon/SHAP
  structure-property modelling).
